== Notes ==
* See [[breach]] for the full list of spells stripped.
* The reduced spell resistance is an [[extraordinary effect]], so it cannot be dispelled.
* In a mage battle, this (level 4) spell's ability to breach two spells can be as effective as a (level 9) [[Mordenkainen's disjunction]] since the breached spells will almost always include either [[spell mantle]], or [[greater spell mantle]], and these are the only arcane spells that can resist a [[Bigby's forceful hand]] other than a [[lesser spell mantle]].
* Due to a .2da bug, neither ''minor globe of invulnerability'' nor ''lesser spell mantle'' is an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

